    ALYSHA "지금 도망쳐!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:338
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_8647421b:

    # "Shani scrambled to her feet and sprinted away from the carnage around us."
    "샤니는 급히 일어나 우리 주변의 참상으로부터 전력 질주했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:340
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_7da413b1:

    # "She scrambled to her feet and sprinted away from the carnage around us."
    "그녀는 허둥지둥 일어나 우리 주변의 참상에서 전속력으로 달아났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:348
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_1b73e7d0:

    # "Before I could help Alysha, the circling skinwalkers turned their attention to me, lunging forward!"
    "알리샤를 도우려는데, 에워싼 스킨워커들이 나에게 주의를 돌리며 앞으로 달려들었다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:357
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_557fed5e:

    # "Having slain the last of them, I turned at the sound of a bloodcurdling scream."
    "마지막 녀석을 해치우고, 나는 피가 얼어붙을 듯한 비명 소리에 몸을 돌렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:362
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_0050ea78:

    # "Alysha's blade clattered to the floor, her eyes wide as she looked down at the bloody stump where her hand had once been."
    "알리샤의 칼이 바닥에 덜컹 떨어졌고, 그녀는 한때 손이 있었던 피투성이 절단면을 내려다보며 눈을 크게 떴다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:363
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_f8250cdd:

    # "With tears in her eyes, she collapsed to the ground, clutching at the wound as one of the things moved to finish her off."
    "하지만 그만큼의 정액이면, 적월이 견딜 수 있을지 궁금하네."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:367
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_8c7d39f8:

    # "With a swipe of my tail, the creature halted mid-strike."
    "쿵 소리와 함께, 내 묵직한 자지가 그녀의 엉덩이 사이에 밀착되어 천천히 그녀의 피부를 문질렀다. 그녀는 긴장한 채 작은 소리를 냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:368
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_f920e40a:

    # "Alysha braced herself, expecting the killing blow—but it never came."
    "알리샤가 죽음의 일격을 예상하며 몸을 움츠렸다—하지만 그것은 결코 오지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:370
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_f90b745f:

    # "Instead, the thing's head rolled across the floor, its lifeless body slumping down next to her."
    "대신, 그 녀석의 머리가 바닥을 굴러갔고, 생명 없는 몸뚱이가 그녀 옆에 털썩 쓰러졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:372
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_64db357e:

    # "In a panic, Alysha tried to crawl away, her breath ragged, her body trembling."
    "공황 상태에서, 알리샤는 기어서 도망치려 했다. 숨은 거칠고, 몸은 떨렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:373
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_95d34b57:

    # MC "Wait!"
    MC  "기다려!"

