    # "Alysha hesitated but grabbed her blade from the ground and hurried to safety."
    "알리샤는 망설였지만 땅바닥에서 칼을 집어 들고 안전한 곳으로 서둘렀다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:415
