    # "As the creature's claws slashed across Shani's throat, a spray of crimson painted the ground."
    "그 생물의 발톱이 샤니의 목을 베자, 진홍빛 물보라가 바닥을 물들였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:427
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_365e8b00:

    # "As the creature's claws slashed across the woman's throat, a spray of crimson painted the ground."
    "그 생물의 발톱이 그 여인의 목을 베자, 진홍빛 물보라가 바닥을 물들였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:430
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_abe6913c:

    # "Her eyes went wide, hands trembling as they clutched at the open wound, desperate to keep the life from pouring out."
    "터진 상처를 움켜잡으며 손이 떨렸다. 생명이 쏟아져 나가는 걸 막으려 필사적으로."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:431
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_9bd17461:

    # "She choked, spasmed, convulsed in agony."
    "그녀는 숨이 막히고, 경련하며, 고통 속에 몸부림쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:434
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_0af86e7b:

    # MC "SHANI!"
    MC "샤니!"

