    ERIKA "이게 끝나면 설명할 게 많을 거야… [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1389
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_2ba733e6:

    # MC "...You know?"
    MC "…알지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1390
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_1ab8689e:

    # "She didn't answer."
    "그녀는 대답하지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1391
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_94255163:

    # "She only glared for a moment before turning to Nyx."
    "그녀는 잠시 노려보다가 닉스에게로 돌아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1392
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_04d25e33:

    # ERIKA "I can escort them to the top of the wall."
    ERIKA "그들을 성벽 꼭대기까지 호송할 수 있어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1393
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_db18630c:

    # ERIKA "The rest of the inquisitors will stay and assist here."
    ERIKA "나머지 심문관들은 여기 남아 지원할 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1394
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_145e0904:

    # NYX "Where is Inquisitor Lorgar?"
    NYX "로르가르 심문관은 어디 있나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1395
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_d9b35ece:

    # ERIKA "We were separated during the attack."
    ERIKA "우리는 공격 중에 흩어졌어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1396
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_e61aa56b:

    # NYX "Then you're in charge?"
    NYX "그럼 네가 책임자야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1397
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_ef9e15fe:

    # "Erika hesitated, glancing at the others."
    "에리카는 다른 이들을 힐끗 보며 망설였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1398
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_a659497e:

    # ERIKA "W-We're all the same inquisitor rank..."
    ERIKA "우-우리 모두 같은 심문관 계급인데…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1399
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_59cb237a:

    # NYX "Fuck it, I don't care."
    NYX "좆까, 상관없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1400
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_a4d414ac:

    # NYX "Go with [player_name!t] and Markus."
    NYX "[player_name!t]랑 마커스와 함께 가."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1401
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_76552809:

    # NYX "Get to the wall and hurry!"
    NYX "성벽으로 가, 서둘러!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1402
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_12afe495:

    # NYX "I don't know how much longer they can hold out up there with the lines severed!"
    NYX "보급로가 끊긴 상태로 위에서 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있을지 모르겠어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1403
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_fbf6224f:

    # ERIKA "Yes, Captain."
    ERIKA "네, 대장."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1422
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_8fa23553:

    # MC "Erika, I—"
    MC "에리카, 나—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1424
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_271ccfcd:

    # ERIKA "Not a fucking word."
    ERIKA "한 마디도 하지 마."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1426
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToArmyDist_9f3efba4:

    # MARKUS "...Good to see you again too, Erika."
    MARKUS "…나도 다시 봐서 반가워, 에리카."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1438
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToHousing2_dbd95526:

    # "...The district, like the others, was ablaze, yet there was an ominous, distinct lack of cries or clashing blades, as though the entire place had fallen silent."
    "...그 구역은 다른 곳들과 마찬가지로 불타고 있었지만, 마치 모든 곳이 침묵에 빠진 것처럼 불길한, 뚜렷한 비명 소리나 검의 충돌 소리가 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1440
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToHousing2_a5458705:

    # "The sickening stench of burning flesh filled the air, thick and heavy."
    "타는 살점의 역겨운 악취가 공기를 두껍고 무겁게 채웠다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1442
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToHousing2_615f551f:

    # "As we pressed forward, the eerie quiet only made everything more unsettling."
    "우리가 앞으로 나아가자, 섬뜩한 고요함이 모든 것을 더욱 불안하게 만들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1444
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToHousing2_a9cf6c8e:

    # ERIKA "We must keep moving..."
    ERIKA "계속 움직여야 한다…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1445
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToHousing2_237601c4:

    # MARKUS "Sister Divine asked us to find the missing Mages of Palam."
    MARKUS "디바인 수녀님이 실종된 팔람의 마법사들을 찾아달라고 하셨어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1447
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToHousing2_5af1a6cd:

    # ERIKA "There is no time for detours!"
    ERIKA "우회할 시간이 없어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1448
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToHousing2_7b3dbf60:

    # ERIKA "The city's safety takes priority!"
    ERIKA "도시의 안전이 우선이다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1458
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_GoToHousing2_16b0163e:

    # ERIKA "This way... I know a shortcut."
    ERIKA "이쪽으로… 지름길을 알아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1467
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_9e4944f2:

    # ERIKA "Fine, but we must hurry!"
    ERIKA "좋아, 하지만 서둘러야 해!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1474
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_46309dca:

    # "We scoured the district, but neither I nor Markus could pick up their scent through the thick smoke."
    "위층 방 중 하나에서 친구를 만나기로 했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1476
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_838c0731:

    # "Suddenly, a sharp cry echoed through the air."
    "갑자기, 날카로운 외침이 허공에 울려 퍼졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1478
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_65fb0b3b:

    # MC "This way!"
    MC "이쪽이야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1479
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_d983de2b:

    # "We followed the sound, hurrying through the burning streets to find the entrance of a noble's manor."
    "우리는 소리를 따라, 불타는 거리를 서둘러 빠져나가 어느 귀족의 저택 입구를 찾아냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1480
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_e92cf3e1:

    # "From inside, I could hear muffled cries of pain."
    "안에서 희미한 고통의 울음소리가 들려왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1482
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_910eb21e:

    # "Slamming a fist against the bolted door, I called out."
    "빗장이 걸린 문에 주먹을 내리치며, 나는 소리쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1483
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_92b4ade6:

    # SOPHIRA "Go away! Be gone, creature!"
    SOPHIRA "저리 가! 꺼져, 생물아!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1484
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_357ae423:

    # MC "Sister Divine sent us! We're looking for the lost Palam mages who never returned!"
    MC "디바인 수녀님이 보내셨어! 돌아오지 않은 팔람의 마법사들을 찾고 있어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1485
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_778ec10a:

    # SOPHIRA "L-Lies! Begone, monster!"
    SOPHIRA "거-거짓말! 꺼져, 괴물아!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1488
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_a350cb10:

    # "Erika stepped forward, slamming her fist against the door."
    "에리카는 앞으로 나서서 문에 주먹을 내리쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1489
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_14f45b1f:

    # ERIKA "By order of the Inquisition, I demand you open this door!"
    ERIKA "종교재판소의 명령으로, 이 문을 열 것을 요구한다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1490
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_4a41de21:

    # "There was a long pause before a sheepish face peeked through the gap."
    "한참의 멈춤 뒤에, 틈새로 수줍은 얼굴이 엿보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1493
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_329c6e6a:

    # "A woman, disheveled and covered in ash, but distinctly noble, oddly resembled Adara in appearance."
    "흐트러지고 재로 뒤덮였지만 뚜렷이 귀족인 여인은, 이상하게도 외모가 아다라를 닮았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1495
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_ee6d7f8e:

    # "Upon seeing me and Markus, she gasped and attempted to slam the door shut, but Erika wedged her foot in before she could."
    "나와 마르쿠스를 보자, 그녀는 숨을 들이키며 문을 닫으려 했지만, 에리카가 그러기 전에 발을 끼워 넣었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1497
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_8e798dd8:

    # SOPHIRA "G-Get back!"
    SOPHIRA "물-물러서!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1498
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_e1310062:

    # ERIKA "Hold!"
    ERIKA "멈춰!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1499
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_10c0580a:

    # ERIKA "They are with me."
    ERIKA "그들은 나와 함께합니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1500
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_cf899e87:

    # "The woman's wide, fearful eyes darted back and forth between me and Markus before she hesitantly turned back to Erika."
    "그 여자의 크게 뜨이고 두려움에 찬 눈이 나와 마르쿠스 사이를 빠르게 오갔다. 그녀가 머뭇머뭇 다시 에리카에게로 돌아서기 전까지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1501
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_c1aa6fc5:

    # ERIKA "Who are you?"
    ERIKA  "누가 나를 부르는가?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1502
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_ca9584e7:

    # SOPHIRA "...I..."
    SOPHIRA  "...나는..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1503
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_f34e4dec:

    # SOPHIRA "I am Lady Maringott, but call me Sophira."
    SOPHIRA "나는 마링고트 부인이지만, 소피라라고 불러줘."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1505
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_dcfb449e:

    # ERIKA "The Mages of Palam—are they here?"
    ERIKA "팔람의 마법사들—그들이 여기 있나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1506
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_0988535a:

    # SOPHIRA "Y-Yes... Come quickly."
    SOPHIRA "으-응… 빨리 와."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1510
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_89f25f4f:

    # "Sophira led us into the main hall of the manor, now a makeshift infirmary littered with wounded men and women."
    "소피라는 우리를 저택의 대강당으로 이끌었고, 그곳은 이제 부상자들로 가득한 임시 의무실이 되어 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1511
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_18de3914:

    # "The air was filled with pained groans as bloodied civilians and soldiers writhed on hastily arranged beds."
    "피투성이의 민간인들과 병사들이 급히 배치된 침상에서 몸부림치며 공기는 고통의 신음으로 가득 찼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1512
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_ef679b7f:

    # "Exhausted Mages of Palam moved frantically, tending to the wounded."
    "지친 팔람의 마법사들이 미친 듯이 움직이며 부상자들을 돌보고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1515
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_be997334:

    # "The chaos of the scene meant few even looked up at us."
    "현장의 혼란 때문에 우리를 올려다보는 이는 거의 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1519
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_4cb32837:

    # ERIKA "What is going on here?"
    ERIKA "여기 무슨 일이야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1520
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_32a7d9bc:

    # SOPHIRA "The attack came so suddenly..."
    SOPHIRA "공격은 너무나 갑작스러웠다…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1521
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_ab1b8518:

    # SOPHIRA "We opened our doors to shelter as many as we could, but the wounded kept piling in."
    SOPHIRA "우리는 가능한 많은 이들을 보호하기 위해 문을 열었지만, 부상자들이 계속 쌓여 들어왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1522
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_08869913:

    # "Her face darkened."
    "얼굴이 어두워졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1523
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_46f9b89b:

    # SOPHIRA "...Some of the mages didn't make it."
    SOPHIRA "…마법사 몇 명은 살아남지 못했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1524
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_c277dfeb:

    # SOPHIRA "But those who remain have been a blessing from the gods."
    SOPHIRA "하지만 남은 자들은 신들의 축복이었어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1525
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_ba99da2c:

    # SOPHIRA "I fear many more would have perished without them."
    SOPHIRA "그들이 없었다면 더 많은 이들이 죽었을 거라 생각합니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1526
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_288b2912:

    # ERIKA "Where is your husband?"
    ERIKA "네 남편은 어디 있지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1527
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_2b343ada:

    # SOPHIRA "My husband lost his legs many years ago."
    SOPHIRA "남편은 여러 해 전에 다리를 잃었어요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1528
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_d5a91e24:

    # SOPHIRA "I've confined him to his room for safety until this nightmare ends."
    SOPHIRA "이 악몽이 끝날 때까지 안전을 위해 그를 방에 가둬뒀어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1529
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_9804f65a:

    # MC "What can we do to help?"
    MC "우리가 뭘 도울 수 있을까?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1530
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_3cc7ceca:

    # SOPHIRA "Please... We need more medicine. The mages are exhausted."
    SOPHIRA "제발… 약이 더 필요해요. 마법사들이 지쳤어요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1531
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_6260956e:

    # ERIKA "Take these people to the main fort. There will be—"
    ERIKA "이 사람들을 주 요새로 데려가. 거기—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1532
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_08946951:

    # SOPHIRA "No!"
    SOPHIRA  "안 돼!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1533
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_16119eaf:

    # SOPHIRA "None of the wounded can fight, and the mages are too drained."
    SOPHIRA "부상자들은 아무도 싸울 수 없고, 마법사들은 너무 지쳤어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1534
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_8bff53d6:

    # SOPHIRA "We'd be slaughtered if we tried to move now."
    SOPHIRA "지금 움직이려 하면 학살당할 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1535
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_b0728f26:

    # MC "Then what do you suggest?"
    MC "그럼 뭘 제안하는 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1536
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_cbc9f014:

    # SOPHIRA "The basement."
    SOPHIRA "지하실."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1537
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_94f195d8:

    # SOPHIRA "There are more medical supplies, food, and water down there."
    SOPHIRA "저 아래에 더 많은 의료품, 식량, 물이 있어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1538
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_1fc6089c:

    # ERIKA "Then why haven't you retrieved them already?"
    ERIKA "그럼 왜 아직 그들을 데려오지 않았지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1539
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_8e33a28a:

    # SOPHIRA "{i}...Something is down there.{/i}"
    SOPHIRA "{i}…아래에 뭔가 있다.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1540
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_069e8943:

    # SOPHIRA "When everything started, we heard strange noises coming from the basement."
    SOPHIRA "모든 게 시작됐을 때, 지하실에서 이상한 소리가 들렸어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1541
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_519c41a4:

    # SOPHIRA "We sent two guards down to check, and then... we heard the most awful sounds."
    SOPHIRA "경비병 둘을 확인하러 내려보냈는데, 그리고… 가장 끔찍한 소리를 들었어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1542
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_856a2c1b:

    # ERIKA "Is the basement secure now?"
    ERIKA "지하실은 이제 안전해?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1543
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_6cd2601f:

    # SOPHIRA "Yes... We bolted and barricaded it shut."
    SOPHIRA "네… 빗장을 지르고 바리케이트로 막았어요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1544
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_4df24ebb:

    # SOPHIRA "{i}But we can still hear something moving down there...{/i}"
    SOPHIRA "{i}하지만 아직도 아래에서 무언가 움직이는 소리가 들려…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1545
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_3ca32141:

    # MC "Where is this basement?"
    MC "이 지하실이 어디야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1546
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_1307e2ea:

    # SOPHIRA "Wait...! Before you go."
    SOPHIRA "잠깐…! 가기 전에."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1547
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_f0cc9421:

    # SOPHIRA "Take these."
    SOPHIRA "이걸 가져."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1552
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_fb70bf95:

    # SOPHIRA "I can't spare much, but... hopefully, you'll be able to clear out whatever's down there."
    SOPHIRA "많이 나눠줄 순 없지만… 바라건대, 저 아래 있는 걸 처리할 수 있길."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1553
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_bf0933ee:

    # ERIKA "Take us to the basement."
    ERIKA "지하실로 데려가줘."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1554
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_ed135172:

    # ERIKA "We don't have much time."
    ERIKA "시간이 별로 없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1563
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_de8d52ca:

    # "...The basement door was heavily barricaded, tables and chairs stacked against it in a desperate attempt to keep something locked inside."
    "...지하실 문은 무겁게 바리케이드가 쳐져 있었고, 테이블과 의자들이 무언가를 안에 가두기 위한 필사적인 시도로 쌓여 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1564
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_5510eb32:

    # "It took several minutes to clear away the debris before we reached the door itself."
    "문 자체에 도달하기 전에 잔해를 치우는 데 몇 분이 걸렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1565
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_2d08aad9:

    # "Sophira hesitated, stepping back as I reached for the handle."
    "소피라는 망설이며, 내가 손잡이에 손을 뻗자 뒤로 물러섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1569
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_f2fd1f30:

    # "As the door creaked open, an eerie darkness stretched down into the unknown."
    "문이 삐걱거리며 열리자, 섬뜩한 어둠이 미지의 곳으로 뻗어 내려갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1571
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_9f7bb532:

    # MARKUS "...You first."
    MARKUS "…네가 먼저."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1572
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_2464d270:

    # "Step by step, we descended into the oppressive darkness, the cold stone beneath our feet making every movement feel heavier."
    "한 걸음씩, 우리는 압도적인 어둠 속으로 내려갔고, 발 아래의 차가운 돌은 모든 움직임을 더 무겁게 느끼게 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1574
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_a5faaf6e:

    # "Elena whined nervously behind me."
    "엘레나는 내 뒤에서 불안하게 낑낑거렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1576
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_20c6c022:

    # MC "Calm, Elena."
    MC "진정해, 엘레나."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1580
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_05531ad1:

    # MYU "T-This seems like a bad idea to Myu..."
    MYU "이-이건 뮤에게 나쁜 생각인 것 같아…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1585
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_784f60a8:

    # "Finally, we reached the bottom."
    "마침내, 우리는 바닥에 닿았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1586
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_a1b18879:

    # "Even in the dim light, I could see the place was a mess—broken crates, toppled shelves, and shattered bottles lay scattered across the floor."
    "어두운 불빛 속에서도, 그곳이 엉망인 걸 알 수 있었다—부서진 상자, 넘어진 선반, 깨진 병들이 바닥에 흩어져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1587
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_d10a2b67:

    # "Food, medicine, and supplies lay in ruined heaps as though some wild beast had rampaged through here."
    "음식, 약품, 보급품이 마치 야수가 이곳을 난동 부린 것처럼 망가진 더미로 널려 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1588
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_b06dde3e:

    # "Most disturbing of all was the heavy trail of blood that led deeper into the room... only to suddenly disappear in the middle of the floor."
    "가장 섬뜩한 것은 방 깊은 곳으로 이어지는 무거운 핏자국이... 바닥 한가운데서 갑자기 사라져버렸다는 점이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1589
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_84dbeb44:

    # "Erika tightened her grip on her sword as a strange dragging sound echoed through the chamber."
    "기이한 질질 끄는 소리가 방 안에 울려 퍼지자, 에리카는 검을 더 꽉 쥐었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1590
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_f34d9a6e:

    # ERIKA "{i}It's still here...{/i}"
    ERIKA "{i}아직 여기 있다…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1591
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_fc93b91b:

    # "A sinister, wet slithering noise grew louder, circling us from the shadows."
    "불길하고, 축축한 미끄러지는 소리가 점점 커지며, 그림자 속에서 우리를 맴돌았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1592
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_07a3131b:

    # "And then, as if the very darkness itself was shifting, everything went still..."
    "그리고 나서, 마치 어둠 자체가 움직이는 것처럼, 모든 것이 멈췄다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1602
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_7b8076d7:

    # "Writhing in agony, the creature let out a sickening bellow as blood sprayed across the walls."
    "네-네!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1604
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_b620a0e1:

    # "In a final desperate lunge, it attempted to strike—but with a swift swipe of my tail, its head tumbled to the floor, lifeless."
    "마지막 필사적인 돌진으로, 공격하려 했지만—내 꼬리의 재빠른 휘두름에, 그 머리는 생명 없이 바닥으로 굴러떨어졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1606
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_503eb673:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Huff*{/i} What in all the gods was that thing?"
    MARKUS "{i}*헉*{/i} 도대체 신들의 이름으로 저건 뭐였지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1608
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_836a7533:

    # ERIKA "{i}I've seen creatures like this before...{/i}"
    ERIKA "{i}이런 생명체를 전에 본 적이 있다…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1609
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_e7942df9:

    # MARKUS "You have?"
    MARKUS "그랬어?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1610
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_8b418497:

    # ERIKA "Dark mages can create many horrors..."
    ERIKA "흑마법사들은 많은 공포를 만들어낼 수 있지…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1611
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_4c777b59:

    # MARKUS "Wait, are you saying dark mages are working with the Demorai?"
    MARKUS "잠깐, 흑마법사들이 데모라이와 손잡고 있다는 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1612
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_a7d1cbb7:

    # ERIKA "Who knows? We don't have time to speculate."
    ERIKA "누가 알겠어? 추측할 시간이 없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1613
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_00904404:

    # ERIKA "Let's go back and tell Sophira it's safe."
    ERIKA "돌아가서 소피라에게 안전하다고 말하자."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1622
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_cc1017a7:

    # SOPHIRA "You're back!"
    SOPHIRA "돌아왔구나!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1623
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_d8f05fb2:

    # SOPHIRA "We heard terrible noises—I feared the worst!"
    SOPHIRA "끔찍한 소리를 들었어—최악을 두려워했어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1624
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_249d38dc:

    # ERIKA "It's safe now."
    ERIKA "이제 안전해."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1625
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_66fbe380:

    # ERIKA "Though I'm afraid much of the medicine may be lost..."
    ERIKA "하지만 약의 상당수가 유실됐을 것 같아 두렵군…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1626
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_bea94ee9:

    # SOPHIRA "We'll make do. Thank you."
    SOPHIRA "그럭저럭 해낼게. 고마워."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1627
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_3a185799:

    # "Sophira turned toward me and Markus, her expression softening."
    "소피라는 나와 마르쿠스에게로 돌아서며, 표정이 부드러워졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1628
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_a3550950:

    # SOPHIRA "...Thank you."
    SOPHIRA  "...고마워."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1629
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_8e36738f:

    # SOPHIRA "You may have saved a lot of lives today."
    SOPHIRA "오늘 많은 목숨을 구했을지도 몰라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1635
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_46afb077:

    # MYU "Hooray! Myu did a good!"
    MYU "만세! 뮤 잘했어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1636
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_42980294:

    # SOPHIRA "A-Ahh... Yes, you did."
    SOPHIRA "아-아… 응, 그랬지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1639
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_90da61ed:

    # ERIKA "We need to go."
    ERIKA "가야 해."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1640
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_98331877:

    # ERIKA "We've wasted enough time."
    ERIKA "시간을 충분히 낭비했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1641
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_8f616c48:

    # SOPHIRA "Wait! Before you leave..."
    SOPHIRA "잠깐! 떠나기 전에…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1642
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_5139d402:

    # SOPHIRA "Let one of the mages tend to your wounds. It's the least we can do."
    SOPHIRA "마법사 중 한 명에게 상처를 치료받게 해. 그게 우리가 할 수 있는 최소한의 일이야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1646
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Prep_b9f6f48a:

    # "...After being healed by one of the mages, we made our way out."
    "...마법사 중 한 명에게 치료를 받은 후, 우리는 밖으로 나갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1650
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_9e4944f2:

    # ERIKA "Fine, but we must hurry!"
    ERIKA "좋아, 하지만 서둘러야 해!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1658
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_46309dca:

    # "We scoured the district, but neither I nor Markus could pick up their scent through the thick smoke."
    "위층 방 중 하나에서 친구를 만나기로 했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1659
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_838c0731:

    # "Suddenly, a sharp cry echoed through the air."
    "갑자기, 날카로운 외침이 허공에 울려 퍼졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1661
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_65fb0b3b:

    # MC "This way!"
    MC "이쪽이야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1662
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_d983de2b:

    # "We followed the sound, hurrying through the burning streets to find the entrance of a noble's manor."
    "우리는 소리를 따라, 불타는 거리를 서둘러 빠져나가 어느 귀족의 저택 입구를 찾아냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1663
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_e92cf3e1:

    # "From inside, I could hear muffled cries of pain."
    "안에서 희미한 고통의 울음소리가 들려왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1665
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_f2d64bb0:

    # "Slamming my fist against it I called out to only be met with silence as my answer."
    "주먹을 내리치며 소리쳤지만, 돌아온 것은 침묵뿐이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1667
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_f5320ddb:

    # "Gripping at the door with my tentacles, I tore the thing open with ease and stepped inside."
    "촉수로 문을 움켜잡아, 나는 쉽게 그걸 찢어 열고 안으로 들어섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1671
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_b6d10b53:

    # "The walls were laced in blood, bodies torn to shreds littered the place."
    "벽은 피로 얼룩졌고, 찢겨나간 시체들이 널려 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1672
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_8caf742f:

    # "Here and there, a bit of bloodied blue flesh and skin as the sickly smell of blood and death filled the air."
    "여기저기 피 묻은 푸른 살점과 피부. 피와 죽음의 메스꺼운 냄새가 공기를 가득 채웠다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1673
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_46abadc0:

    # "It appears the mansion had been used as some kind of makeshift hospital."
    "그 저택이 일종의 임시 병원으로 사용되었던 모양이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1674
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_d5c2bc59:

    # "Or at least, it {i}was{/i} before something got in."
    "아니면 적어도, 뭔가가 들어오기 {i}전에는{/i} 그랬지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1677
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_812649d0:

    # "Erika turned a shade of white as she struggled not to throw up."
    "에리카는 토할 것 같은 것을 참느라 얼굴이 백짓장처럼 창백해졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1678
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_d43eae69:

    # ERIKA "Gods... What happened in here?"
    ERIKA "신들이시여… 여기 무슨 일이 있었던 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1680
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_17e1d435:

    # MARKUS "It doesn't look like they managed to put up much of a fight..."
    MARKUS "별로 저항하지 못한 모양이군…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1681
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_9cbf423d:

    # "A snapping sound echoed through the halls, followed by another ghastly scream."
    "딱 부러지는 소리가 복도에 메아리쳤고, 또 다른 끔찍한 비명이 뒤따랐다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1685
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_18f10e05:

    # UNKNOWN "AHHHHHHHH!"
    UNKNOWN "아아아아아아아!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1686
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_65fb0b3b_1:

    # MC "This way!"
    MC "이쪽이야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1689
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_9893b43a:

    # "Chasing the screams led us down a hallway towards a strange entranceway leading underground."
    "비명을 따라가니 복도 끝 지하로 통하는 낯선 입구가 나타났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1690
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_3e65ada3:

    # "With shattered chains around the entranceway, {i}something{/i} must have broken out."
    "입구 주변의 부서진 사슬들과 함께, {i}무언가{/i}가 탈출했음에 틀림없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1691
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_3cc2ee74:

    # "A bone-chilling crunching sound was heard as we descended the stairs into that deep and terrible darkness."
    "계단을 내려가 그 깊고 끔찍한 어둠 속으로 들어갈 때, 뼛속까지 오싹한 으스러지는 소리가 들렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1694
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_fd50f717:

    # "There... waving a torch around the flooded basement, the water up to our ankles, we looked around for the source of the sound."
    "거기... 물에 잠긴 지하실에서 횃불을 휘두르며, 발목까지 물이 차오른 채, 우리는 소리의 근원을 찾아 주위를 둘러보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1695
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_b164bb17:

    # "Slowly moving the light from left to right across the debris, there...{i}we saw it.{/i}"
    "잔해 위로 빛을 천천히 왼쪽에서 오른쪽으로 움직이며, 거기서…{i}우리는 그것을 보았다.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1697
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_cdd450ae:

    # "A snake like creature with a humanoid like body, sinking it's teeth once more into the woman in a blue dress."
    "인간형 몸체를 가진 뱀 같은 생물이, 파란 드레스를 입은 여인에게 다시 한 번 이빨을 박아넣었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1698
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_2d53ad4b:

    # "She let out one last raspy cry of pain as the thing chewed on her, the deep red sinking through and overpowering the blue."
    "그것이 그녀를 씹어먹으며 깊은 붉은색이 스며들어 파란색을 압도하자, 그녀는 마지막 거친 고통의 비명을 질렀다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1699
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_ae6c5a83:

    # "Pale white, she seemed completely drained of all life as the eyes of her ghastly, skeleton white face rolled up."
    "창백하게 질린 그녀는, 섬뜩한 해골처럼 하얀 얼굴의 눈이 뒤집히며 완전히 생명이 빠져나간 듯 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1700
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_18470e76:

    # "The creature snarled, tosing her now lifeless body aside, letting it slam against one of the walls as we heard the bones break."
    "그 생명체가 으르렁거리며 이제 생명 없는 그녀의 몸을 옆으로 던져 벽에 부딪히게 했고, 우리는 뼈가 부러지는 소리를 들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1703
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_1a712d20:

    # "It licked at it's bloody fangs before lunging towards us!"
    "그것은 피 묻은 송곳니를 핥고는 우리에게 달려들었다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1713
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_96fa915c:

    # "Slicing my claws across the creature's throat, the snakeman waved back and force, reaching at it's gaping wound where it's throat once was."
    "내 발톱이 그 생명체의 목을 가르자, 뱀인간이 앞뒤로 흔들리며 목이 있던 자리의 벌어진 상처를 더듬었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1714
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_1027db08:

    # "After letting out a desperate, raspy cry, it collapsed face first into the water, twitching for a few moments before falling completely still."
    "필사적이고 쉰 외마디 비명을 지른 후, 그것은 물속으로 얼굴부터 쓰러져, 완전히 멈추기 전 몇 순간 경련했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1715
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_0374e7bc:

    # MC "What in the hells is this thing?"
    MC "이건 도대체 뭘까?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1716
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_4b2c1c99:

    # MC "Some kind of... dark magecraft abomination?"
    MC "일종의… 흑마법 흉측한 것이야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1718
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_79c627e2:

    # ERIKA "I... I've never seen anything like it before."
    ERIKA "나… 이런 건 전에 본 적이 없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1719
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_591afddc:

    # ERIKA "It appears to be... {i}part human?{/i}"
    ERIKA "보아하니… {i}일부는 인간?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1721
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_ec77576a:

    # MARKUS "We should leave this place, whatever this {i}thing{/i} is, the inquisitors and whoever can look at the damn thing when we're done."
    MARKUS "우리는 이곳을 떠나야 해, 이 {i}것{/i}이 뭐든 간에, 심문관과 다른 누군가가 우리가 끝나면 그 빌어먹을 걸 살펴볼 수 있게."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1723
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_38177186:

    # "I nodded in agreement as we made our way back up through the mansion estate."
    "저택 부지를 통해 다시 올라가면서 동의의 뜻으로 고개를 끄덕였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1725
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_8bfc939c:

    # "I took one last look at the dead bodies littered around... Perhaps..."
    "널브러진 시체들을 마지막으로 한 번 바라봤다... 어쩌면..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1727
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_6725b4fe:

    # "{i}Perhaps if things were different, I could have saved them.{/i}"
    "{i}어쩌면 상황이 달랐다면, 나는 그들을 구할 수 있었을 텐데.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1729
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_Unprep_bb0c8ed4:

    # ERIKA "[player_name!t], let's go."
    ERIKA "[player_name!t], 가자."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1738
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_e1032b47:

    # "Navigating through the chaotic streets, Erika guided us through a series of alleyways and back routes."
    "혼란스러운 거리를 헤쳐 나가며, 에리카는 일련의 골목길과 뒷길을 통해 우리를 안내했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1739
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_ff091e7a:

    # "Finally, pushing through to the main street, we hurried toward our destination."
    "마침내 큰길로 밀고 나가, 우리는 목적지를 향해 서둘렀다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1740
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_f2ac90ca:

    # ERIKA "We must move quickly before—"
    ERIKA "빨리 움직여야 한다, 전에—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1742
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_58420e88:

    # "There, amidst a heap of mangled corpses, sat the gleaming, towering figure of the Silver Knight."
    "거기, 엉망으로 찢긴 시체들 속에서, 빛나는 은빛 기사의 우뚝 솟은 형체가 앉아 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1743
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_1df97ea7:

    # "His cape fluttered in the wind as the city burned around him, his presence eerily still in the midst of carnage."
    "도시가 불타는 가운데 망토가 바람에 펄럭였다. 학살 속 존재감은 섬뜩하게 고요했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1744
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_042dbc76:

    # "Despite the splattering of blood across his armor, his silver plating still shined brilliantly through the filth."
    "갑옷에 피가 튀었음에도, 그의 은빛 판금은 오물 사이로 여전히 눈부시게 빛났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1749
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_78e5318e:

    # SILVER_KNIGHT "..."
    SILVER_KNIGHT "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1751
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_e51a3c47:

    # "Slowly, he tilted his head up, locking his piercing gaze onto us."
    "천천히, 그는 고개를 들어 올려, 꿰뚫는 시선을 우리에게 고정했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1753
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_31385b2d:

    # "His grip on his massive sword tightened as he rose to his feet, advancing in our direction."
    "거대한 검을 더 꽉 쥐며 일어서서 우리 방향으로 다가왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1754
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_a455176a:

    # MARKUS "F-Fuck! It's him! It's the Silver Knight himself!"
    MARKUS "제-젠장! 그야! 실버 나이트 본인이야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1755
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_0aea49c7:

    # "The Silver Knight... A warrior of legend, chosen to serve and die for the royal family of Alderay."
    "실버 나이트… 전설의 전사, 알더레이 왕실을 위해 섬기고 죽도록 선택받은 자."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1756
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_3702506d:

    # "Possessing unmatched skill in both blade and magecraft, it was said that he was perhaps the only man who could have challenged Newheart and won."
    "검술과 마법 모두에서 비길 데 없는 실력을 지녀, 아마도 뉴하트에게 도전하여 이길 수 있었을 유일한 남자라고 전해졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1757
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_485f73a4:

    # "...And now, he was coming straight for us."
    "...그리고 이제, 그가 우리를 향해 곧장 다가오고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1758
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_ad3944f0:

    # ERIKA "Hold, Sir Knight! HOLD!"
    ERIKA "멈춰, 기사님! 멈춰!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1760
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_7b45065b:

    # "The Silver Knight stopped in his tracks, eyes narrowing as he examined me and Markus."
    "실버 나이트는 걸음을 멈추고, 나와 마르쿠스를 살피며 눈을 가늘게 떴다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1761
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_5fe8b642:

    # "His posture remained unreadable, but his grip on his weapon remained firm."
    "자세는 읽을 수 없었지만 무기를 쥔 손은 굳건했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1763
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_6ddf1665:

    # SILVER_KNIGHT "…What are they?"
    SILVER_KNIGHT "…뭐지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1764
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_8709d483:

    # ERIKA "As of now, these... creatures are under the order of the Inquisition."
    ERIKA "지금부터, 이… 생물들은 종교재판소의 명령 아래 있습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1765
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_e74bc1de:

    # SILVER_KNIGHT "I do not concern myself with the affairs of the Inquisition."
    SILVER_KNIGHT "나는 종교재판소의 일에 신경 쓰지 않소."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1766
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_ff96d9a5:

    # SILVER_KNIGHT "Only that the royal family remains safe."
    SILVER_KNIGHT "왕실 가족이 안전하게 남아있다는 것뿐입니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1767
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_cd3ce366:

    # "Erika gulped, the color draining from her face as she likely questioned whether even all of us combined could stop the Silver Knight."
    "에리카는 침을 삼켰다. 우리 모두 합쳐도 은빛 기사를 막을 수 있을지 의문을 품은 듯, 얼굴에서 핏기가 가셨다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1768
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_e5d01a38:

    # MC "Princess Cecilia has tasked us with finding her brother, Prince Naran, and returning him to the castle."
    MC "세실리아 공주께서 남동생 나란 왕자를 찾아 성으로 귀환시키는 임무를 우리에게 맡기셨다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1769
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_15b97946:

    # "The Silver Knight studied me carefully before turning his gaze to Erika."
    "실버 나이트는 나를 신중히 살핀 후 시선을 에리카에게로 돌렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1770
translate kr qst_JudgementDay_RescueMages_MoveOn_f04727a6:

