    # MC @ sad "You're no ordinary dark mage, are you?"
    MC @ sad "넌 평범한 암흑 마법사가 아니지, 그렇지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2377
